  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 3.6 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Win-back offers can now be configured using `win-back-offers`. These are offers to bring back churned or expired customers to a subscription.  To learn more, see `Creating-and-configuring-win-back-offers`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/win-back-offers",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/Creating-and-configuring-win-back-offers"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Developers can now use `subscription-images` and `in-app-purchase-images` endpoints to manage images for promoting subscriptions and in-app purchases.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/subscription-images",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/in-app-purchase-images"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Age ratings for Australia and Korea can be read using `GET-v1-appInfos-_id_`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appInfos-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There are two new attributes available for age rating declarations. Use `PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_` to set the attributes `lootbox` and `koreaAgeRatingOverride`, to learn more, see `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AgeRatingDeclarationUpdateRequest/Data-data.dictionary/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `INSTALLS` report type now has a detailed and summary monthly option for `GET-v1-salesReports`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-salesReports"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `Attributes-data.dictionary` resource now has two additional `contentStatuses` possible values, `ICP_NUMBER_MISSING` and `ICP_NUMBER_INVALID`. To learn more, see the “Availability in China mainland” section in `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-information`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/TerritoryAvailability/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-information"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Developers can now upload screenshots for Apple Watch Series 10, to learn more about possible values, see `ScreenshotDisplayType`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/ScreenshotDisplayType"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Developers can now add an app encryption declaration for a given app using `POST-v1-appEncryptionDeclarations`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-appEncryptionDeclarations"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Improvements",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The OpenAPI specification (`https://developer.apple.com/sample-code/app-store-connect/app-store-connect-openapi-specification.zip`) values has improved `operationId` names and the Apple managed `https://github.com/apple/swift-openapi-generator` now produces more readable names for the App Store Connect API operations.",
          "refs": [
            "https://developer.apple.com/sample-code/app-store-connect/app-store-connect-openapi-specification.zip",
            "https://github.com/apple/swift-openapi-generator"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`SubscriptionStatusUrlVersion` normalized to all caps values such as `V1` and `V2`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/SubscriptionStatusUrlVersion"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `GET-v1-apps` resources now has more optional filters, including `reviewSubmissions.state`, `reviewSubmissions.platform`. The optional field `appAvailabilityV2` is also now available.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-apps"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `GET-v1-appStoreVersions-_id_` endpoint now includes `gameCenterAppVersions` fields.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appStoreVersions-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `GET-v1-subscriptions-_id_-pricePoints` endpoint now requires a `territory` filter.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-subscriptions-_id_-pricePoints"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `purchaseRequirement` attribute for `Attributes-data.dictionary` now correctly shows as a `string` type.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AppEvent/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `app` relationship to `POST-v1-appEncryptionDeclarations` has been deprecated.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-appEncryptionDeclarations"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `promoted-purchase-images` endpoints have been deprecated and replaced with `subscription-images` and `in-app-purchase-images`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/promoted-purchase-images",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/subscription-images",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/in-app-purchase-images"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The duration `ONE_DAY` has been removed from from `SubscriptionOfferDuration`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/SubscriptionOfferDuration"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
